        "definition": "flowchart TD\n    Client[Client] --> CB[Circuit Breaker]\n    CB -->|Closed| Retry[Retry]\n    CB -->|Open| Fallback[Fallback]\n    Retry -->|Success| Svc[Service]\n    Retry -->|Fail| Fallback\n    Fallback -->|Degraded| Response[Response]"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "data": {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Best Practices"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "bullet-list",
      "data": {
        "items": [
          "Design for failure",
          "Keep services loosely coupled",
          "Monitor and observe everything",
          "Automate testing and deployment"
        ]
      }
    },
